# A scale links two distances

One centimetre on a map can represent one kilometre on the ground.

:::mcf-end

:::mcf-activity
type: practice
id: scale-practice
:::

```mcf-question
id: scale-number
type: numeric
prompt: "How many kilometres does a 2.5 cm route represent?"
answer: 2.5
unit: km
```

:::mcf-end
